# Copy to .env and fill in your bot token.
DISCORD_TOKEN=your-bot-token-here

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# AI (optional). Without this the Mafia narrator uses its built-in script and
# everything else works exactly the same.
#
# Any provider that speaks the OpenAI chat-completions shape works. Groq is the
# recommended default: free tier, and fast enough that a night is written long
# before the night ends.
#
#   groq        https://console.groq.com/keys          free tier, fastest
#   openrouter  https://openrouter.ai/keys             many models, one key
#   openai      https://platform.openai.com/api-keys   paid
#   together    https://api.together.xyz/settings/api-keys
#   ollama      run it yourself, no key needed
#
# Measured on this prompt, which asks for four versions of a night as one JSON
# object. Small models manage the prose but not the structure:
#
#   openai/gpt-oss-120b  (groq)    1.5s   usually all four versions   <- default
#   llama3.1:8b          (ollama)  5-11s  all four, but thin and fragmentary
#   openai/gpt-oss-20b   (groq)    0.5s   one beat per version; unusable
#   llama3.2 (3B)        (ollama)  8s     cannot hold the shape
#   qwen/qwen3.8-27b     (groq)    17s    nothing parseable
#
# Groq has retired the Llama models, so check what your key can actually reach:
#   curl -H "Authorization: Bearer $LLM_API_KEY" \
#        https://api.groq.com/openai/v1/models
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# LLM_PROVIDER=groq
# LLM_API_KEY=gsk_your-key-here

# Optional. Overrides the provider's default model.
# LLM_MODEL=openai/gpt-oss-120b

# Reasoning models bill their thinking against max_tokens and will spend all of
# it planning if allowed to. Narration is atmosphere, not a maths problem.
# LLM_REASONING_EFFORT=low

# Running Ollama instead? It needs JSON mode (sent automatically) to produce
# valid output, and it needs to stay loaded -- a cold start is ~73s, which
# misses the window and falls back to the built-in script:
#   LLM_PROVIDER=ollama
#   LLM_MODEL=llama3.1:8b
#   and set OLLAMA_KEEP_ALIVE=-1 in Ollama's own environment

# Optional. Only for something self-hosted or not in the list above.
# LLM_BASE_URL=http://localhost:11434/v1

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Night illustrations (optional, and off until you set this). One picture per
# Mafia night, posted as the closing beat of the story. Nothing is generated
# unless you name a provider here.
#
#   pollinations  no signup, no key, keyless GET       easiest
#   huggingface   https://huggingface.co/settings/tokens   better models
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# IMAGE_PROVIDER=pollinations

# Needed for huggingface, ignored by pollinations.
# IMAGE_API_KEY=hf_your-token-here

# Optional. Overrides the provider's default model.
# IMAGE_MODEL=black-forest-labs/FLUX.1-schnell
